WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:01.701 line:0%
-Hey!

00:00:01.701 --> 00:00:03.636 line:0%
-Oh, come on, you look great!

00:00:03.636 --> 00:00:05.938
Thank you so much
for coming on the show.

00:00:05.938 --> 00:00:09.342
What -- I love the hair,
or the non-hair. What --

00:00:09.342 --> 00:00:12.878
-The non-hair. It's growing out
just a little bit right now.

00:00:12.878 --> 00:00:15.281
Thank you.
I'm loving it, too.

00:00:15.281 --> 00:00:17.216
My man cut it for me last week.

00:00:17.216 --> 00:00:19.252
I am, like, cutting it
every two weeks.

00:00:19.252 --> 00:00:21.787
-Is this something you
always wanted to do?

00:00:21.787 --> 00:00:24.223
-Well, yeah, I always wanted
to do it.

00:00:24.223 --> 00:00:26.458
For years I've been talking
about cutting my hair.

00:00:26.458 --> 00:00:29.128
And you know, this whole
quarantine

00:00:29.128 --> 00:00:32.098
and everything made me think,
like, "Well, why not now?"

00:00:32.098 --> 00:00:33.967
I'm not going to be on any
red carpets.

00:00:33.967 --> 00:00:35.734
And if I have to be on
something,

00:00:35.734 --> 00:00:37.637
they always put me in wigs
anyways.

00:00:37.637 --> 00:00:39.571
And the wigs sit better.

00:00:39.571 --> 00:00:42.275
And so I was just like, yeah,
let's just go for it.

00:00:42.275 --> 00:00:44.810
And I did it online
so everybody could see,

00:00:44.810 --> 00:00:48.381
because I wanted to know what I
look like from my head to toe.

00:00:48.381 --> 00:00:50.583
Like, who am I
from head to toe?

00:00:50.583 --> 00:00:54.220
You know, every religion
talks about knowing thy self.

00:00:54.220 --> 00:00:55.955
And I know where
all my moles are

00:00:55.955 --> 00:00:57.924
except for the ones
that were on my head.

00:00:57.924 --> 00:01:00.292
And now I know I got two moles
on my head.

00:01:00.292 --> 00:01:01.995
It's a little wrinkly
in the back.

00:01:01.995 --> 00:01:03.963
You know, and --

00:01:03.963 --> 00:01:05.497
When it's all the way gone...
-You know you.

00:01:05.497 --> 00:01:06.733
-...it's very smooth.

00:01:06.733 --> 00:01:08.768
My head kind of feels
like a penis.

00:01:08.768 --> 00:01:10.703
And that's kinda nice.
-Wow.

00:01:10.703 --> 00:01:12.772
-It's kinda nice.
-Okay, I'll take it.

00:01:12.772 --> 00:01:14.507
I love that.
-That might have been too far,

00:01:14.507 --> 00:01:17.744
but I'm just sharing
the knowledge.

00:01:17.744 --> 00:01:20.080
I'm learning new things about
myself every day

00:01:20.080 --> 00:01:22.415
now that I'm bald-headed,
you know, like --

00:01:22.415 --> 00:01:24.417
-I know you did
stand-up again.

00:01:24.417 --> 00:01:27.887
I want to say, how did it feel
to be in front of a crowd?

00:01:27.887 --> 00:01:29.989
An audience?

00:01:29.989 --> 00:01:32.325
-It was amazing.

00:01:32.325 --> 00:01:36.062
Like, the best sex ever. Okay?
-[ Laughing ]

00:01:36.062 --> 00:01:37.697
-It was the best.

00:01:37.697 --> 00:01:40.800
Like, to be in front of
that live audience.

00:01:40.800 --> 00:01:43.135
And granted,
everyone had on masks,

00:01:43.135 --> 00:01:45.370
so you couldn't hear
the laughter right away,

00:01:45.370 --> 00:01:46.672
but you could see it.

00:01:46.672 --> 00:01:48.507
Everybody'd get a little
squinty eyes

00:01:48.507 --> 00:01:51.110
when they laugh, and their
heads are bobbing

00:01:51.110 --> 00:01:52.978
and hands are clapping.

00:01:52.978 --> 00:01:55.781
And so you find new cues
to accept.

00:01:55.781 --> 00:01:58.984
And I just -- by the end of it,
I felt like a Care Bear.

00:01:58.984 --> 00:02:00.686
I felt like I was doing, like,
the Care Bear stare

00:02:00.686 --> 00:02:05.124
where you're just like,
"Yes, jokes, jokes, jokes!"

00:02:05.124 --> 00:02:06.492
-Everybody's getting
beamed out.

00:02:06.492 --> 00:02:08.394
Oh, I love it.
[ Laughs ]

00:02:08.394 --> 00:02:10.229
It was so good.

00:02:10.229 --> 00:02:12.064
It was so amazing.

00:02:12.064 --> 00:02:13.900
-The last time you were here,
we talked about

00:02:13.900 --> 00:02:15.968
your special, "Black Mitzvah,"

00:02:15.968 --> 00:02:17.937
and it was right
before it came out.

00:02:17.937 --> 00:02:20.539
And now it is Emmy-nominated
"Black Mitzvah."

00:02:20.539 --> 00:02:23.342
So congratulations, you got
nominated for an Emmy!

00:02:23.342 --> 00:02:25.444
-Thank you.
You know, it's so awesome

00:02:25.444 --> 00:02:27.112
to be recognized by my peers.

00:02:27.112 --> 00:02:28.848
That's, like, amazing.

00:02:28.848 --> 00:02:31.784
And the same day that I found
out, I felt very grateful.

00:02:31.784 --> 00:02:34.854
But I went to the mailbox,
and there was all these

00:02:34.854 --> 00:02:37.290
handwritten notes
from these foster youth

00:02:37.290 --> 00:02:39.592
that I have been talking to
over the quarantine.

00:02:39.592 --> 00:02:41.960
I've been Zoom-calling with
a bunch of foster kids

00:02:41.960 --> 00:02:43.595
in different group homes.

00:02:43.595 --> 00:02:47.733
And it was 40 messages,
40 little handwritten notes

00:02:47.733 --> 00:02:51.770
and cards, and they, like, drew
on them and colored them,

00:02:51.770 --> 00:02:54.507
and that was the best
award ever.

00:02:54.507 --> 00:02:56.509
Like, that was better
than anything.

00:02:56.509 --> 00:02:57.877
And, like, when I get down,

00:02:57.877 --> 00:02:59.746
I just open those up
and read them.

00:02:59.746 --> 00:03:03.482
It's like, that's better than
any trophy I could ever get.

00:03:03.482 --> 00:03:04.884
-Oh, I love it.

00:03:04.884 --> 00:03:07.253
-To be recognized by, you know,
our youth, our future.

00:03:07.253 --> 00:03:09.422
-Good for you for doing that.
That's so cool that you do that.

00:03:09.422 --> 00:03:11.323
And that's the reward.
It's so cool.

00:03:11.323 --> 00:03:13.059
I love it.
-Yeah, it's great.

00:03:13.059 --> 00:03:15.561
-How has your -- has
your stand-up changed

00:03:15.561 --> 00:03:17.897
since the pandemic
and, obviously,

00:03:17.897 --> 00:03:20.900
the protests
for social justice?

00:03:20.900 --> 00:03:22.234
-Well, definitely.

00:03:22.234 --> 00:03:23.502
You know, people are
always asking me,

00:03:23.502 --> 00:03:24.770
"Tiffany, what can we do?

00:03:24.770 --> 00:03:26.205
What can we do to
make change in --"

00:03:26.205 --> 00:03:28.507
And what I've incorporated
in my comedy

00:03:28.507 --> 00:03:30.543
is something that I think
that would work,

00:03:30.543 --> 00:03:32.745
that would change
the systemic racism

00:03:32.745 --> 00:03:35.181
and the injustices
that we all suffer.

00:03:35.181 --> 00:03:38.350
And I think the key to it is
all women

00:03:38.350 --> 00:03:39.685
just stop having sex.

00:03:39.685 --> 00:03:41.320
Everyone just close their legs,

00:03:41.320 --> 00:03:43.055
just shut it down.

00:03:43.055 --> 00:03:46.426
Men will get -- I know this has
happened in history before.

00:03:46.426 --> 00:03:48.294
Wars have stopped
because of this.

00:03:48.294 --> 00:03:50.863
If every woman just said,
"That's it, I'm closing my legs

00:03:50.863 --> 00:03:54.233
until justice is served,
until there is change,"

00:03:54.233 --> 00:03:55.901
then things will be great.

00:03:55.901 --> 00:03:57.770
Now the Karens will be
overwhelmed

00:03:57.770 --> 00:03:59.272
because they don't want
change, right?

00:03:59.272 --> 00:04:01.106
The Karens want things
to stay the same.

00:04:01.106 --> 00:04:02.641
So the Karens are
going to be overwhelmed,

00:04:02.641 --> 00:04:04.476
and after so long,
they're going to be like,

00:04:04.476 --> 00:04:06.479
"Look, okay, we got to start
voting, people."

00:04:06.479 --> 00:04:07.980
Karens are going to be out there
getting people

00:04:07.980 --> 00:04:09.515
registered to vote.

00:04:09.515 --> 00:04:11.283
They're going to be talking to
black people, Spanish people.

00:04:11.283 --> 00:04:12.518
They're going to be talking
to --

00:04:12.518 --> 00:04:13.886
Karens are going to be like,

00:04:13.886 --> 00:04:15.521
"Look, I know, I was talking
crazy a few months ago --"

00:04:15.521 --> 00:04:16.989
-Now --
-"But I cannot handle

00:04:16.989 --> 00:04:18.557
all this sex that I got to do

00:04:18.557 --> 00:04:20.693
because everybody
shut their legs closed.

00:04:20.693 --> 00:04:22.695
So, please, please
register to vote.

00:04:22.695 --> 00:04:24.263
Please, let's make some change."

00:04:24.263 --> 00:04:25.531
-Wow, that is the way to do it.

00:04:25.531 --> 00:04:26.899
That's the way to get
some change.

